  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A constant net force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acts on a body of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> that is initially at rest. Which of the following is an expression for the kinetic energy of the body after a time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F^2 t^2}{2m}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F t^2}{2m}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F^2 t^2}{m}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F^2 t}{2m}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
